    "text": "Amy is given the pretty {ART} table at a charity fair, but jealous May Chester takes it from her, and puts Amy at the {FLOWER} table in a dark {CORNER}. Amy is {GRACIOUS}, and even lends May her own {VASES}. Next day Laurie and his friends buy up every {BOUQUET}, and Amy’s table is the most {POPULAR} in the hall.",
